  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3002.17 Maintenance area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.17 \"Maintenance area\" means \"maintenance area\" as defined in the US EPA's proposed Model Open Market Trading Rule (60 FR 39668, August 3, 1995), namely, \"any area with a maintenance plan approved under section 175 of the Act.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
